00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:51.990
And I'm going to change
everything and the font to Arial.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:57.150
So I need to select everything,
click on the font and select Arial.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:00.750
And that's changed everything to
Arial size 11, which I'm happy with.

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:06.005
I'm also going to apply
some shading to the top row.

00:04:06.005 --> 00:04:08.115
So I'm going to use the fill for that.

00:04:08.145 --> 00:04:11.775
So if I go up and use the fill
colour, and I'm just going to

00:04:11.775 --> 00:04:16.425
select a blue background for that.

00:04:17.685 --> 00:04:22.935
And as you can see, I could then
apply various other colour formatting.

00:04:22.935 --> 00:04:26.355
So you may want to display the
information and the total income.

00:04:26.355 --> 00:04:27.675
So that's a financial figure.

00:04:27.675 --> 00:04:30.465
You may want to display that
in a different colour to the

00:04:30.465 --> 00:04:32.265
