00:04:48.835 --> 00:04:51.325
Please bear in mind, though,
that you don't want to overload

00:04:51.475 --> 00:04:52.645
the worksheet with colours.

00:04:53.515 --> 00:04:57.895
In addition to that, as you can see, none
of the information has borders around it.

00:04:58.165 --> 00:05:01.945
So what I'd like to do is apply a
border to all of the information.

00:05:02.365 --> 00:05:08.125
So again, all I would do is highlight
all of the information and on the

00:05:08.215 --> 00:05:11.305
borders tool and select all borders.

00:05:12.465 --> 00:05:15.435
And that just breaks the
information up even further.

00:05:16.395 --> 00:05:20.715
So as well as that, you also have
the option to format the information

00:05:20.715 --> 00:05:24.885
as a table, and you can also
apply styles to the information.

00:05:25.065 --> 00:05:29.355
So you could have a look and play
around with the table styles, as you

00:05:29.355 --> 00:05:32.625
